OL,3,GNEWSA'Painful condition meant I had to
OL,4,Aleave my job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter years of suffering the pain of
OL,7,Fendometriosis, 21-year-old Charlotte
OL,8,FSamphire was forced to leave her job
OL,9,Fbecause the symptoms were too severe to
OL,10,Fmanage.
OL,12,FNow, the beauty therapist from East
OL,13,FYorkshire, along with Hull charity Hey
OL,14,FEndo!, is hoping improvements will soon
OL,15,Fbe made after a government report found
OL,16,Fthe condition is having a significant
OL,17,Fimpact on women's finances and careers.
OL,19,F"People need to know that women
OL,20,Fshouldn't have to choose between their
OL,21,Fcareers and their health," she said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
