OL,3,GNEWSA'Painful condition meant I had to
OL,4,Aleave my job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamphire, who has stage 4 endometriosis
OL,7,Fand has suffered years of debilitating
OL,8,Fpain since she was just 10 years old,
OL,9,Fsaid although her boss was
OL,10,Funderstanding, she knows not everyone
OL,11,Fwould be so lucky.
